{"id":"soe96lsaumj99bh7g5xxpzw4b","title":"东北特色菜：乱炖、溜肉段与拔丝土豆","originalTitle":"那方水土那方人22. 七 食在当年（8）","summary":"东北人喜爱乱炖、溜肉段和拔丝土豆等家常菜。溜肉段是用瘦肉切条或丁，用水淀粉挂糊油炸后炒制而成，是作者小时候吃过最讲究的菜。拔丝土豆则是用土豆切块过油后熬糖制成，需掌握好火候才能成功。这些菜肴反映了当时物资匮乏时期人们的饮食习惯。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3622817&do=blog&id=1561596"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T01:55:22.279Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T01:55:22.279Z","category":"clinical","tags":["论文发表"],"score":10,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}